WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:02.170
Sixteen forty-nine.

2
00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:06.010
King Charles the First is
put on trial, and executed.

3
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:09.610
England becomes a republic,
with no king at all.

4
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.650
Then, in sixteen sixty,

5
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:15.090
the dead king's son is
invited back to rule.

6
00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:18.170
How did a king and his
Parliament end up at war?

7
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.110
Was it rich against poor?

8
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.370
And why did the monarchy return?

9
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.550
In this mission, you'll sort
the causes of the Civil War,

10
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.990
and meet a general
called Oliver Cromwell,

11
00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:30.970
who ruled but was never king.

12
00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:35.030
Your mission: explain how England
went from a king, to no king,

13
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.580
and back again.
